{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6A34AAE8","title":"Simple ending","entry":"Dlg_6A34AAE8::entry","exit":"Dlg_6A34AAE8::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_3C40B874","articyId":"72057645577593188","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"They say when you hear your name in a dream, you wake up. Is your name Thaddeus?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They say when you hear your name in a dream, you wake up. Is your name Thaddeus?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32090","byteOffset":20021328,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_A0CCFCBA","articyId":"72057645577593224","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"No. But he sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. But he sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20728","byteOffset":15726464,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_40852AF7","articyId":"72057645577593231","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"If you're getting this message, it means the process failed. I guess it was my time. Damn! I feel tired though. I just wanted to clear up some things before I shuffle off stage.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you're getting this message, it means the process failed. I guess it was my time. Damn! I feel tired though. I just wanted to clear up some things before I shuffle off stage.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42571","byteOffset":30433784,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_C75869CD","articyId":"72057645577593259","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think there was more to this mystery... but we did not solve it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think there was more to this mystery... but we did not solve it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2875.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36039","byteOffset":27980704,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_E77D1847","articyId":"72057645577593266","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"With any luck, you'll never hear this message. And if you do... well, there's one thing you should know. If you've ever felt like you're different from everyone else - like you're unique - you are. More than you can ever know, you are.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"With any luck, you'll never hear this message. And if you do... well, there's one thing you should know. If you've ever felt like you're different from everyone else - like you're unique - you are. More than you can ever know, you are.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3175.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43987","byteOffset":30976288,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_1641A56B","articyId":"72057821671327936","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"No. He sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. He sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23848","byteOffset":16902184,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_BAA4479B","articyId":"72057645577593195","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh?","TextSheVersion":"Huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":475.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33548","byteOffset":20574688,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_34EAEEAE","articyId":"72057645577593200","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No!","TextSheVersion":"No!","TextTheyVersion":"No!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":475.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24407","byteOffset":17111144,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_A0904BDF","articyId":"72057645577593209","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"It seems...The process failed.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It seems...The process failed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":775.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27914","byteOffset":18441656,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_75F0D3DE","articyId":"72057645577593217","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","TextSheVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","TextTheyVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21873","byteOffset":16163552,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_627E7902","articyId":"72057645577593238","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"The message origin is clear. It came from Sang Ha. I believe he was there all along.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The message origin is clear. It came from Sang Ha. I believe he was there all along.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40651","byteOffset":29707296,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_EC34197A","articyId":"72057645577593245","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"You thought Ava was spying on you, and that wasn't the whole truth. All this time, I was watching you through the eyes of your friends. If you were just a smidge more curious, I'd have more to tell you. As it stands, best we keep it simple.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You thought Ava was spying on you, and that wasn't the whole truth. All this time, I was watching you through the eyes of your friends. If you were just a smidge more curious, I'd have more to tell you. As it stands, best we keep it simple.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45547","byteOffset":31563216,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_41F737A3","articyId":"72057645577593252","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What 